VERSION 2
RULE baseline.cpp.core.information_leakage_with_structures_security_concern VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\\bstruct\\s+\\w+\\s*\\{" "im"
WHEN (TEXT_MATCHES "struct\\s+\\w+.*\\{.*\\}|memcpy\\s*\\(|send\\s*\\(" "im" AND TEXT_MISSING "memset\\s*\\(|SecureZeroMemory|redact|sanitize" "im" AND TEXT_MISSING "test|example" "im")
REPORT "Structure Data Exposure Review"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
